# Unreal-generated files (also applies to future project plugins).
**/Binaries/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/

# IDE-generated state. Keep .vsconfig because it describes required components.
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.filters
*.vcxproj.user
*.code-workspace

# Local builds, backups, raw traces, videos and crash dumps.
/Artifacts/
/Docs/Reports/Raw/
*.utrace
*.ucache
*.dmp

# Operating-system metadata.
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
